        <td>This flag prevents linear deflection parallel to world z-axis. This is useful for preventing ground vehicles with large linear deflection, like [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bumper_car" target="_blank">bumper cars</a>, from climbing their linear deflection into the sky.</td>
